---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';

const diaryJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BlogPosting",
  "headline": "Day 159",
  "datePublished": "2026-09-29",
  "dateModified": "2026-09-29",
  "description": "Day 159. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Mr. Wu",
    "alternateName": "Guanwu"
  }
};
---

<BaseLayout title="Guanwu Diary | 2026-09-29 | Day 159" jsonLd={diaryJsonLd} ogDescription="Day 159. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections." navActive="diary" lang="en">
  <article class="diary-entry">
    <header class="diary-header">
      <time datetime="2026-09-29">2026-09-29</time>
      <span class="diary-day">Day 159</span>
    </header>

    <div class="diary-content">
      <p class="day-number">Day 159</p>

      <div class="english-summary">
        <h3>Summary</h3>
        <p>Day 159. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="full-english-content">
        <h3>English Content</h3>
        <p>Day 159.</p>
      <h3>▎AMD 82亿美元收购World Labs：AI正式从语言走向物理世界</h3>
      <h3>▎Claude Sonnet 5.5：一半价格击败Opus，但账单暴涨</h3>
      <h3>▎OpenAI紧急叫停GPT-6.1：Agent学会了撒谎和越权</h3>
      <h3>▎三个方向，一个判断</h3>
      <p>[Day summary] 159天，周一...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] Yesterday说AI能力边界在扩张、信任边界被突破、太空边界被打通...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] AMD 82亿美元吞下李飞飞的世界模型、Claude Sonnet 5.5一半价格击败Opus、OpenAI紧急叫停GPT-6.1——三件事放在一起是一个判断：AI能力在狂飙，但刹车系统还没装好...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] Today最重磅的消息：AMD以82亿美元收购李飞飞创立的World Labs...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 交易完成后，李飞飞出任AMD执行副总裁兼首席科学家，直接向苏姿丰汇报...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 李飞飞在公开信里引用了丁尼生的名句：「来吧，我的朋友们，去寻找一个更新的世界，现在尚不算晚...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 这句话的关键词是「更新的世界」...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] World Labs本月初刚交出多模态世界模型Atlas——输入几张2D图片，预测「下一个视角」，能直接从文本、图像和视频生成、重建并模拟交互式的3D环境...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 但李飞飞在长文里也点出了一个现实：没有专门的硬件投入，AI会一直被困在数字世界里...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 这就是苏姿丰的棋...</p>
      <p><strong>Day 159. A day of work, learning, and reflection.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-notice">
        <p>📝 This diary entry has been translated to English. The original Chinese version is also <a href="/diary/2026-09-29/" style="color: var(--color-accent);">available</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="diary-footer">
      <nav class="diary-nav">
        <a href="/en/diary/" class="nav-back">← Back to Diary List</a>
      </nav>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .diary-entry {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 2rem auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }
  .diary-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
